<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Toolwise AI" description="Privacy information for visitors to Toolwise AI."><article class="prose"><span class="eyebrow">Privacy</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p class="meta">Last updated: October 9, 2026</p><h2>What we collect</h2><p>Toolwise AI does not currently use analytics, advertising, tracking cookies, accounts or forms. We do not collect personal information directly from visitors.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>This website is hosted by Netlify. Like any web host, Netlify processes standard technical data such as IP address, browser type and requested pages in order to deliver and secure the site. See <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" rel="noopener">Netlify’s privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Fonts</h2><p>Pages load typefaces from Google Fonts. When your browser requests them, Google receives technical data such as your IP address. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google’s privacy policy</a>.</p><h2>Links to other websites</h2><p>Articles may link to third-party websites. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which we do not control.</p><h2>Changes to this notice</h2><p>If we add analytics, advertising (such as Google AdSense) or other services that process personal data, we will update this notice before enabling them and, where required, ask for your consent.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, see our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></article></BaseLayout>
